Package: networkDEA
Type: Package
Title: Network Data Envelopment Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Fatih", "Sağlam", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "saglamf89@gmail.com")
Description: Efficiency measurement with network data envelopment analysis
    (DEA), where each decision making unit is opened up into connected
    sub-processes (nodes) linked by intermediate products. Implements
    two-stage network DEA with the classical centralized model (Kao and Hwang,
    2008; Liang, Cook and Zhu, 2008) and the flexible-synergy model of the
    MaxDEA Team (2026), under constant and variable returns to scale with input
    or output orientation, and a generalized network DEA model for arbitrary
    serial and parallel node structures (MaxDEA Team, 2026). Linear programs
    are solved with 'lpSolve'. This is an independent implementation of
    published methods and is not affiliated with MaxDEA Software Ltd.
URL: https://github.com/fatihsaglam/networkDEA
BugReports: https://github.com/fatihsaglam/networkDEA/issues
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: lpSolve, stats
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
